flowchart LR
  EXT[Canonical Chrome MV3 extension]
  WEB[React dashboard and marketing site]
  API[FastAPI CRUD API]
  AUTH[Supabase Auth]
  EDGE[Supabase Edge Functions\nchat / RAG / coaching / live token]
  RT[Supabase Realtime]
  DB[(Supabase Postgres\nRLS-protected user data)]
  STORAGE[(Supabase Storage\noptional session captures)]
  VERTEX[Vertex AI / Gemini]

  EXT -->|JWT + CRUD/session sync| API
  WEB -->|JWT + profile/session/rubric/action CRUD| API
  EXT -->|auth/session + chat/live calls| AUTH
  WEB -->|auth + chat/RAG calls| AUTH
  EXT -->|authenticated chat, live, sync| EDGE
  WEB -->|authenticated chat, RAG, coaching| EDGE
  API -->|user-scoped queries| DB
  AUTH -->|identity records| DB
  EDGE -->|RLS-scoped reads/writes| DB
  EDGE -->|optional screenshot objects| STORAGE
  EDGE -->|server-side model invocation| VERTEX
  EDGE -->|cross-surface events| RT
  RT -->|chat/session updates| EXT
  RT -->|chat/session updates| WEB
